<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conchȳlĭātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of a purple color</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peristromata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Phil. 2, 27, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 39, 64, § 138</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 43</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 54, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Marc. Emp. 9</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Clothed in purple</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">relictis conchyliatis cum illo seminudo loquor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 62, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
